<div id="c4b" class="c4b-wrap">

  <section class="c4b-big" aria-label="Crawl4AI Cloud is live">
    <div class="c4b-in">
      <div class="c4b-text">
        <div class="c4b-eyebrow"><span class="c4b-tag">New</span> good news for everyone who runs Crawl4AI</div>
        <h2 class="c4b-title">Crawl4AI <em>Cloud</em> is live.<br>The same crawler, hosted.</h2>
        <p class="c4b-lead">No browsers to run, no proxies to buy, no cookies to babysit. One key with <b>free credits every month</b>, and your AI agent can <b>scrape, extract, search, read Google's results page (SERP) and answer questions</b> through the same engine you already use. Free: 10 a minute, 2 at a time, 1,000 credits every month. Plans: 120 a minute, 10 at a time, from $10 a month.</p>
        <p class="c4b-oss"><b>Always open source, forever.</b> The library stays here and stays free. The cloud is for the days you want to build fast and let us run the infrastructure.</p>
        <div class="c4b-cta">
          <a class="c4b-btn" href="https://crawl4ai.com/?ref=docs-banner" data-c4b-ev="banner_key_clicked">Get a key, free credits every month →</a>
          <a class="c4b-btn c4b-ghost" href="https://crawl4ai.com/?ref=docs-banner" data-c4b-ev="banner_cloud_clicked">See Crawl4AI Cloud</a>
        </div>
        <div class="c4b-meta"><span>no card</span><span><b>free credit</b> to start · soft launch: prices can change, what you buy stays yours</span><span>EU · Singapore · US</span><span>MCP built in</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="c4b-paste" aria-label="Paste this into your agent">
        <div class="c4b-tabs" role="tablist">
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-c4b-client="claude">Claude Code</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-c4b-client="codex">Codex</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-c4b-client="opencode">OpenCode</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-c4b-client="cursor">Cursor</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-c4b-client="curl">curl</button>
        </div>
        <pre class="c4b-code" id="c4b-code"></pre>
        <div class="c4b-foot"><span>Paste it once. Your agent gets the whole web.</span><a href="https://crawl4ai.com/docs?ref=docs-banner" data-c4b-ev="banner_docs_clicked">cloud docs →</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="c4b-x" aria-label="Close" data-c4b-act="close">×</button>
    <label class="c4b-hide"><input type="checkbox" id="c4b-never"> don't show this again</label>
  </section>

  <div class="c4b-small">
    <span class="c4b-star">★</span>
    <span class="c4b-t"><b>Crawl4AI Cloud is live</b> — the same crawler, hosted. Get a key with free credits every month and paste one line into your agent.</span>
    <span class="c4b-sp"></span>
    <a class="c4b-go" href="https://crawl4ai.com/?ref=docs-banner" data-c4b-ev="banner_key_clicked">Get a key →</a>
    <button type="button" data-c4b-act="expand">show</button>
  </div>

